Package: krdpc
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: acebmxer
Priority: optional
Section: net
Homepage: https://github.com/acebmxer/krdpc
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-pyside6.qtcore, python3-pyside6.qtgui, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, python3-keyring, freerdp3-x11, libqt6svg6
Description: native KDE list of remote computers that opens each with FreeRDP
 krdpc is a small native KDE desktop app, laid out like Remmina's main window.
 It keeps a list of your remote computers, asks for the password (or remembers
 it in KDE Wallet) and opens each one with FreeRDP's xfreerdp. It is not an RDP
 engine.
